# faction-mix-wide.vrs: wave-variety D13 (design §9 D61), which units of each faction fight beside each other.
# Per group: one of each candidate combat unit and V Blood (Reference Data/unit_index.tsv by faction, level 10+, leaving out
# villagers, animals, mounts, summons and minions, gate bosses, objects and the raid bosses Dracula, Adam and Morgana) is
# spawned at the pond with `.nyar spawn`; Chaos stands 40 m east for 60 s, then among them, invulnerable, for 30 s. A unit
# counts as allied when no "died (killer CHAR_<group>" line names it in either phase and `.devunits` still counts it.
# `.devkill` clears each pass twice (spawns are staggered). Generated by the session's genmixwide.py; results go to
# docs/GAME_ASSETS.md › Faction compatibility and docs/features/WAVE_VARIETY.md › Test results.
# Needs: [Debug] VerboseLogging = true (the died line names its killer); [Limits] ManualSpawnLifetimeSeconds = 1800 (a
# pass of 30 lasts past the 300 s default and its units expire unseen); NyarDevTools (.devgo .devtp .devmark .devunits
# .devkill), DevChatEcho; the pond mark; Chaos invulnerable (true only).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
# pass undead: 23 units, 7 V Bloods
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 5
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 1
chat .devmark mix-undead
expect-log \[DEV MARK\] mix-undead
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Cultist_Pyromancer 1
expect-log spawn batch: .* 0 waiting timeout=30
wait 1
